    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "# Upload a File\n\nTo upload an image, navigate to the **Files** panel and select the **+** sign. \n\nThen, select **Upload**.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/f14278949b3e72fdc78a60c2ae5d76e3-upload.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson3-panel2_2026-66f7378c-2577-4044-98f2-99e16a4feb5a"
      },
      {
        "text": "# Select Your Images\n\nSelect the images you want to feature on your website. \n\nMake sure they are saved as a `.png` or `.jpg` file.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/7d2e23c0040cf71cc4e6b8870ff5b979-upload_plant.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson3-panel2_2026-011d6f4b-2601-4708-8c3f-9ec93a6dfaa8"
      },
      {
        "text": "# Option A: Use AI to Add Your Images\n\nYou can use AI Tutor to add your images. Make sure to reference the specific file names, for example:\n\n> In `index.html`, replace the two placeholder images with `plant1.png` and `plant2.png`.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/85216c5233be842a28dbe5fa89ade9be-useAI.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson3-panel2_2026-a097e32a-f777-47b8-ae45-74194e5d867a"
      },
      {
        "text": "# Option B: Rename the Placeholders Yourself\n\nFind where the placeholder images are in your `index.html` file and replace them with your image names.\n\nMake sure to write the file name exactly as you named it, for example `plant1.png`.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/d751f1c9981f16842ff5fcabce02ea00-typing.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson3-panel2_2026-d348c297-0284-4908-9559-036a73170e4a"
      },
      {
        "text": "# Preview Your Work",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/641988f78cba77414510a4dc5ba37f54-preview.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson3-panel2_2026-f47bf11c-df05-4532-86e0-54bd5b55c4de"
      },
      {
        "text": "# Versioning Your Code\n\nTo restore a previous version of your webpage, navigate to the \"Version History\" tab. \n\nSelect the version you want to restore and click **Restore**.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a95a774bee9a473fd18bc45a163a143d-revert.gif",
